      "sajda": false,
      "arabic_text": "﻿بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ",
      "english_translation": "In the name of God, The Most Gracious, The Dispenser of Grace:"
